  "description": "R-PAR-1 PAR-ORDER, SQL-REL: Which tied rows (ins) does SELECT TOP n ins FROM table ORDER BY k return for n = 1, 5, 36, 37, 38 and 80 (the tie groups of k are 36 or 37 rows, so n = 36, 37 and 38 cut a tie group) on OT5, OT3 and OT4 (one GetRows(300) per statement)? Runs on a fresh copy of r-par-1-order opened read-only through DAO OpenDatabase in one process and one STA; each statement is opened with Database.OpenRecordset as a snapshot unless stated, and every call's result, HRESULT and DBEngine.Errors are captured.",
